id: fortitude
name: Fortitude
talentCategory: threshold
prerequisites: Diehard
description: >
  You are nearly unstoppable, continuing to fight well past when others would have dropped.
text: >
  Fortitude: You are nearly unstoppable, continuing to fight well past when others would have dropped.
  –Prerequisites: Diehard
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase your Maximum Life Points by 2 for each of your Power Levels.
  (2)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you fail a Steadfast Check, you may reroll that Steadfast Check, but you must take the second result.

---

[passive]
# (1) As Diehard's: 2 for each Power Level.
life.perLevel += 2;
# (2) A Steadfast Check failed: rerolled from its card, beside the Karmic Effects - the second result taken, and what failing or
# passing it does done again; once an Encounter (chat.mjs fortitudeRerollOption).
allow fortitude.reroll;
